  "description": "A CLI tool that automatically generates JSDoc comments for TypeScript functions, methods, getters, setters, classes, interfaces (including their property and method signatures), enums (including their members), and type alias declarations. Uses a real TypeScript-compiler AST (via a bundled Node sidecar) when Node is available, falling back to an in-process parser otherwise. Supports configurable ignore patterns for test files.",
  "id": "TsCommentify",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-08T09:51:50.35Z",
